<o:LogicalDiagram Id="o660">
<a:ObjectID>C49CB501-26A9-434D-A7DC-5A6FC4F80C84</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Reservoir</a:Name>
<a:Code>RESERVOIR</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The Reservoir EDC Area includes information about the identification, location, and characterization of porous and permeable subsurface rock units that contain individual and separate natural accumulations of producible hydrocarbon fluids, which are confined by impermeable rock or water barriers, forming a single natural pressure system. This Area does not include information about associated fields, plays, or basins. This Area does not include information about measurements of actual fluid flows drawn from reservoirs to the surface to extract produced hydrocarbons or associated aggregations or forecasts.</a:Comment>
<a:Stereotype>DataArea</a:Stereotype>
