<a:Comment>Manufactured, non consumable and uniquely identifiable objects that are of importance to the enterprise to track at the individual instance level. This represents the technical or &#39;physical&#39; part of the Plant Maintenance Asset structure as opposed to Functional Locations. Instrument is a subtype of equipment, used directly or indirectly to measure and/or control a variable.</a:Comment>
