<a:Comment>Covers the definition and data structures for geographically and/or political bounded areas of goverment, legal, regulatory or management relevance. This could be but is not limited to a country or subdivision thereof, tax region, market region, grouping of countries such as the European Union, disputed areas, etc.</a:Comment>
