<o:LogicalDiagram Id="o1450">
<a:ObjectID>283D6C45-539A-44F4-89AC-9ABA18318779</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Legal Agreement</a:Name>
<a:Code>LEGAL_AGREEMENT</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Covers current and historical information about authorization or consents to undertake operations or business activities. . This can be referred as License, Contract, Lease, Concession and allows to track detailed information about the contents of applications, documents or other material submitted as supporting materials and relationships to any licenses or consents received as a result.</a:Comment>
