<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The Seismic Survey EDC Area includes information about field surveys using waves of elastic energy and the refraction and reflection thereof in the subsurface that are used to interpret the composition, fluid content, extent and geometry of rocks in the subsurface. The Area covers the totality raw, processed, and synthetic data, in any number of dimensions, in time and depth, navigation data, acquisition data (line, shot point coordinates, gun settings) pertaining to the survey. This Area covers seismic inversion and synthetic seismic data, but excludes the interpretation of the subsurface itself - notwithstanding the mutual dependency between the data types. The area covers the totality raw, processed, and synthetic data, in any number of dimensions, in time and depth, navigation data, acquisition data (line, shot point coordinates, gun settings) pertaining to the survey. This area covers seismic inversion and synthetic seismic data, but excludes the interpretation of the subsurface itself - notwithstanding the mutual dependency between the data types.</a:Comment>
<a:Stereotype>DataArea</a:Stereotype>
