<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The Field EDC Area includes information about the identification, location, extent, and characteristics of subsurface hydrocarbon and mineral resources accumulation pools. This includes information about the management and operation of a field as a commercial asset for the purpose of extracting hydrocarbon and mineral resources. This Area excludes inforamtion about larger and wider geographic and geologically relevant areas, such as basins, as well as information about the reservoir or reservoirs that exist within the extent of a field.</a:Comment>
