<o:NoteSymbol Id="o1639">
<a:Text>Business Area and Country can be spatially located in 2 dimensions.
Geologic Basin, Exploration Area, Prospect, Field, and Reservoir can be spatially located in 3 dimensions.</a:Text>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
