<o:NoteSymbol Id="o1642">
<a:Text>Field Types in the &quot;official&quot; Upstream Asset Hierarchy list are:
 1) Formal Field;
 2) Field Grouping Area;
 3) Field Accounting Area;
 4) Dummy Field.

Only &quot;Formal Field&quot; and &quot;Field Grouping Area&quot; are in scope for the Field Data Area.</a:Text>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
