<a:Text>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.22621}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs29 Covers the issues relating to data access and security \endash  which enables users to control of access to data, and what can be done with it. \par
