<o:LogicalDiagram Id="o1902">
<a:ObjectID>F02D2594-F0B0-4E2E-ABE4-7A270F6DFE8A</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Completion</a:Name>
<a:Code>COMPLETION</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Completion is a overloaded term that means many different things depending on context.  
It has to do with all the things that have to be done between a borehole being finished drilling to TD, 
to the well being put on production. 
We have avoided using the term &quot;Completion&quot; in OSDU, preferring &quot;Perforated Interval&quot;, &quot;Isolated Interval&quot;, &quot;Wellbore Opening Interval&quot;, &quot;Well Equipment&quot; as less ambiguous terms.</a:Comment>
<a:Stereotype>DataArea</a:Stereotype>
