<o:NoteSymbol Id="o1903">
<a:Text>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.22621}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs29 Completion is has to do with all the things that have to be done between a borehole being finished drilling to TD, to the well being put on production\f1  and plugged and abandon later\f0 . \par
\f1 WORK IN PROGRESS\fs20\par
}
</a:Text>
