<o:Entity Id="o1857">
<a:ObjectID>776F3F57-A9F2-4E42-9EAF-C3883BF8A49A</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Risk</a:Name>
<a:Code>RSK</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>In the context of Shell and the broader energy and petrochemical industry, &quot;RISK&quot; refers to the potential for an event or condition to occur that could have negative consequences on health, safety, security, the environment, or business operations. Risk is typically assessed in terms of both the likelihood of the event occurring and the severity of its potential impact..</a:Comment>
<a:Annotation>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Segoe UI;}}
\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs19 *** BUSINESS OWNER:\par
Risk Management\par
}</a:Annotation>
