<o:Entity Id="o357">
<a:ObjectID>F5E6026C-B699-4350-97B6-F58E76670636</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Rig Work Unit Type</a:Name>
<a:Code>RG_WRK_UNT_TYP</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A kind of Rig-Work Unit used to carry out Well Activities such as Drilling, Completing, Workovers, Interventions, and Abandonments.  Some Rig-Work Unit types are simple in nature, but others are complex equipment configurations.  Some example types are Completion Package, Drill Ship, Jack-Up, Land Rig, Semi-Submersible Unit, Snubbing Unit, and Wireline Unit, but there are many others.

Rig-Work Unit Types can classify Rig-Work Units.
</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Futura Medium;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\colortbl ;\red64\green64\blue64;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.18362}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\cf1\kerning24\f0\fs16 A kind of Rig-Work Unit used to carry out Well Activities such as Drilling, Completing, Workovers, Interventions, and Abandonments.  Some Rig-Work Unit types are simple in nature, but others are complex equipment configurations.  Some example types are Completion Package, Drill Ship, Jack-Up, Land Rig, Semi-Submersible Unit, Snubbing Unit, and Wireline Unit, but there are many others.\par
\par
Rig-Work Unit Types can classify Rig-Work Units.\par
\cf0\kerning0\f1\fs20\par
}
</a:Description>
<a:ExtendedAttributesText>{C6AC31EB-C90E-4811-BE11-ED1545ECDA32},SHL_CDM_EntityPropertyExtension,78={E0F77D32-9090-47F3-BD8E-72D82BA88119},EntityUpdateDate,17=19/08/2021 Pass 3

