A Well Activity can be Well Planning/Designing, Drilling, Completing, Assuring Operational Readiness, Operating/Producting, Maintaining, Restimulating</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Futura Medium;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
