{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.18362}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\cf1\kerning24\f0\fs16 A Work Activity Nature Type/Group\par
\par
A Well Activity can be Well Planning/Designing, Drilling, Completing, Assuring Operational Readiness, Operating/Producting, Maintaining, Restimulating, or Decommissioning/Abandoning.\cf0\kerning0\f1\fs20\par
}
</a:Description>
