{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.17763}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\cf1\kerning24\f0\fs16 A prediction that can be determined based on the Reservoir Performance Model. Currently, this data model identifies two kinds of Predictions:\par
 - Pore Pressure Prediction\par
 - Fracture Gradient Prediction\par
\cf0\kerning0\f1\fs20\par
}
</a:Description>
