<o:Entity Id="o947">
<a:ObjectID>72B1B47C-F899-497D-8738-17E4B03BB2D0</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Reservoir Performance Model</a:Name>
<a:Code>RSRVR_PRFRMNC_MDL</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Reservoir performance affects the economic viability of a play or prospect and is a function of reservoir system quality. Performance is expressed by
 - Initial production rate and production rate decline over time
 - The percentage of hydrocarbon recovered from the hydrocarbon originally in place (recovery factor)
 - The Reservoir Performance Model is the model that may include any of the geological, fluid or other characteristics of the reservoir that have an impact on the reservoir performance.
</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Futura Medium;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset2 Symbol;}}
{\colortbl ;\red89\green89\blue89;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.17763}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\cf1\kerning24\f0\fs16 Reservoir performance affects the economic viability of a play or prospect and is a function of reservoir system quality. Performance is expressed by\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\&#39;B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\&#39;B7}}\fi-270\li270 Initial production rate and production rate decline over time\par
{\pntext\f2\&#39;B7\tab}The percentage of hydrocarbon recovered from the hydrocarbon originally in place (recovery factor)\par

\pard The Reservoir Performance Model is the model that may include any of the geological, fluid or other characteristics of the reservoir that have an impact on the reservoir performance.\par

\pard\cf0\kerning0\f1\fs20\par
}
</a:Description>
