<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The Reserve EDC Area includes information about the quantities of hydrocarbons estimated to be commercially recoverable by application of development projects to known accumulations from a given date forward under defined conditions. This Area does not include information about reservoirs or about the measurements and calculations of actual hydrocarbon production quantities.
</a:Comment>
