<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>For a sample that has been recombined from separate samples, e.g. liquid sample and vapor sample, this object records the specified: recombination conditions (pressure and temperature), recombination ratio, the saturation pressure and  target recombined sample composition, whichever of these are appropriate for this recombination effort.</a:Comment>
