<a:Code>PRJCT_PRMSS_RPRT</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The Project Premises Document (PPD) is generated at the start of a project and is used to document what the project is and is not.  It is kept evergreen throughout the front end of the ORP to ensure that information and business premises are understood by all involved.

Project Premises Reports can be integrated Field Development Documents.

</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Futura Medium;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
