{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.17763}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\cf1\kerning24\f0\fs16 The Project Premises Document (PPD) is generated at the start of a project and is used to document what the project is and is not.  It is kept evergreen throughout the front end of the ORP to ensure that information and business premises are understood by all involved.\par

\pard\cf0\kerning0\f1\fs20\par
}
</a:Description>
