<o:Entity Id="o548">
<a:ObjectID>05B67441-F695-43AB-BD41-2D07D6D0534B</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Production Related Material</a:Name>
<a:Code>PRDCTN_RLTD_MTRL</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A substance (liquid or gas) that can flow into (inject) or out of (produce) a Well for the ultimate purpose of producing hydrocarbons.

Production Related Materials can be primary produced hydrocarbons for Reservoirs.
</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.17763}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20 Subset of Material Types needed for production purposes.\par
\par
Material Type is an object or good that is identified and measured by quantity, volume, or count. A Material Type may or may not be uniquely identifiable, but it is not tracked at the individual instance level, as it is not important to the enterprise to track these items at that level.\par
}
</a:Description>
