<o:Entity Id="o1269">
<a:ObjectID>A0962FDA-8BD0-4486-A2F0-FCB0C0C84A64</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Production Plan</a:Name>
<a:Code>PRDCTN_PLN</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Production Plan is a rolling 90-day plan, updated monthly, to provide economic and operational direction in order to maximise cash and meet contractual obligations. It quantifies all feedstock, products and energy consumption and is translated into details to create lifting schedules, LNG tanker schedules, blend recipes, etc. It is important that the Production Plan is represented on a margin or revenue basis. For upstream Asset type (in both the Upstream and Integrated Gas Lines of Businesses) the Production plan is derived from the forecast. 
</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.17763}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20 Production Plan is a rolling 90-day plan, updated monthly, to provide economic and operational direction in order to maximise cash and meet contractual obligations. It quantifies all feedstock, products and energy consumption and is translated into details to create lifting schedules, LNG tanker schedules, blend recipes, etc. It is important that the Production Plan is represented on a margin or revenue basis. For upstream Asset type (in both the Upstream and Integrated Gas Lines of Businesses) the Production plan is derived from the forecast.\par
}
</a:Description>
