<a:Comment>Forecast values are the individual fully qualified values that experss numeric (e.g. volumes), dates (e.g. first production), or currency (e.g. anticipated revenue / costs). The nature of eah forecast value is defined by a reference to a pre-defined parameter type.</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.17763}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20 Forecast values are the individual fully qualified values that experss numeric (e.g. volumes), dates (e.g. first production), or currency (e.g. anticipated revenue / costs). The nature of eah forecast value is defined by a reference to a pre-defined parameter type.\par
}
</a:Description>
