<o:Entity Id="o1267">
<a:ObjectID>10397FD8-3300-4142-B17C-387F704114AB</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Production Forecast Objective</a:Name>
<a:Code>PRDCTN_FRCST_OBJCTV</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Captures objectives of Production Forecast which are driven from business requirements. Objectives may differ within each Exploration and Production phase or the Opportunity Realisation Standard (ORS) phase or forecast time scale. Some example of objectives are:

During the  Exploration Phase, the objective is to support exploration venture plans, Group Investment Proposals (GIP), Proposal to Commence Negotiations (PCN), etc.

During the Appraisal Phase, the objective is to either justify further appraisal and/or testing or to
demonstrate sufficient economic robustness to mature a development concept.

During the Development phase, objectives are to underpin concept selection,
FDP, PCP, well planning and Group Investment Proposals (GIP).

Objectives of Short-term forecast can be for e.g. Meet contractual (sales) obligations., Optimise oil or LNG tanker scheduling etc.
</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.17763}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20 Captures objectives of Production Forecast which are driven from business requirements. Objectives may differ within each Exploration and Production phase or the Opportunity Realisation Standard (ORS) phase or forecast time scale. Some example of objectives are:\par
\par
During the  Exploration Phase, the objective is to support exploration venture plans, Group Investment Proposals (GIP), Proposal to Commence Negotiations (PCN), etc.\par
\par
During the Appraisal Phase, the objective is to either justify further appraisal and/or testing or to\par
demonstrate sufficient economic robustness to mature a development concept.\par
\par
During the Development phase, objectives are to underpin concept selection,\par
FDP, PCP, well planning and Group Investment Proposals (GIP).\par
\par
Objectives of Short-term forecast can be for e.g. Meet contractual (sales) obligations., Optimise oil or LNG tanker scheduling etc.\par
}
</a:Description>
