<o:Entity Id="o1808">
<a:ObjectID>29489D8C-02B1-4838-876F-E1FDBF9C7F93</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Exploration Area</a:Name>
<a:Code>EXPLRTN_AR</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>An earth subsurface volume that is identified as being of interest for exploration activities. There are 4 subtypes representing a progression of steps in an exploration qualifying process: play, lead, prospect, and discovery.

Exploration Areas can be spatially contained by Geologic Basins.

Exploration Areas can geologically contain Prospects.

</a:Comment>
