<o:EntityAttribute Id="o2082">
<a:ObjectID>3331B3EA-03F5-4701-8C42-026DF8287962</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Facility_ID</a:Name>
<a:Code>FCLTY_ID</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775818171</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818171</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Unique Identifier for Facility
Facility ID uniquely identifies the Facility throughout it&#39;s lifecycle - The fac-id is a 32 character, hexa-decimal number that is randomly generated.  For example:  9446022-d361-446b-8db7-d3f5be834ba2</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>A36</a:DataType>
<a:Length>36</a:Length>
<a:LogicalAttribute.Mandatory>1</a:LogicalAttribute.Mandatory>
