<o:EntityAttribute Id="o2081">
<a:ObjectID>44EDDA0F-F4E5-4457-BB5F-187642264C31</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Work_Activity_ID</a:Name>
<a:Code>WRK_ACTVTY_ID</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818155</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A system generated unique identifier representing the carrying out of Work.  It may be as high-level as a programme or as detailed as a task.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>N13</a:DataType>
<a:Length>13</a:Length>
<a:LogicalAttribute.Mandatory>1</a:LogicalAttribute.Mandatory>
</o:EntityAttribute>
<o:EntityAttribute Id="o2083">
<a:ObjectID>F5A48D11-6E6C-4867-95F8-957E0AEFE655</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Work_Indicator</a:Name>
<a:Code>WRK_INDCTR</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818155</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Where the Work Activity has a financial perspective, set this indicator to &#39;Y&#39;.
Where the Work Activity has a planning (e.g. project scheduling) perspective, set this indicator to &#39;Y&#39;.
Where the Work Activity has an integrated perspective (aka the enterprise perspective), set this indicator to &#39;Y&#39;.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>A1</a:DataType>
<a:Length>1</a:Length>
<a:LogicalAttribute.Mandatory>1</a:LogicalAttribute.Mandatory>
</o:EntityAttribute>
<o:EntityAttribute Id="o2084">
<a:ObjectID>6DEE3C1F-941E-409E-8235-11CA2E757475</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Work_Activity_Name</a:Name>
<a:Code>WRK_ACTVTY_NM</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818155</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A brief description of a Work Activity. E.g. project name, activity name, description of Work Order operation.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>VA250</a:DataType>
<a:Length>250</a:Length>
</o:EntityAttribute>
<o:EntityAttribute Id="o2085">
<a:ObjectID>B2709034-4FD5-4E20-ADCB-F9DDAC57A643</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Work_Activity_Description</a:Name>
<a:Code>WRK_ACTVTY_DSCRPTN</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818155</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A further qualification of a Work Activity Object&#39;s location, e.g. textual description of where, along a pipeline, a repair is required.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>A1500</a:DataType>
<a:Length>1500</a:Length>
</o:EntityAttribute>
<o:EntityAttribute Id="o2086">
<a:ObjectID>69E1CD5B-5B7D-4D32-995C-758F4558F32B</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Work_Activity_Location_Description</a:Name>
<a:Code>WRK_ACTVTY_LCTN_DSCRPTN</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818155</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A further qualification of a Work Activity Object&#39;s location, e.g. textual description of where, along a pipeline, a repair is required.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>VA240</a:DataType>
<a:Length>240</a:Length>
</o:EntityAttribute>
<o:EntityAttribute Id="o2087">
<a:ObjectID>A13A1204-82CB-4DB1-B538-39F0050A590A</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Work_Activity_Number</a:Name>
<a:Code>WRK_ACTVTY_NMBR</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818155</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A numeric sequence that can be used for identifying work activities or sequencing work activities.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>N10</a:DataType>
<a:Length>10</a:Length>
</o:EntityAttribute>
<o:EntityAttribute Id="o2088">
<a:ObjectID>BC2EB908-DCCB-49DA-AAF1-364FB5F4388F</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Measured_Depth</a:Name>
<a:Code>MSRD_DPTH</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818155</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Top Measured depthT(his is the measured depth closest to the surface.  It is measured from the Well&#39;s datum (typically the original KB, will be defined for each Well), down the wellbore.) or Bottom Measured Depth (This is the bottom measured depth, i..e. furthest from the surface.  It is measured from the Well&#39;s datum (typically the original KB, will be defined for each Well), down the wellbore.)</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>N15,4</a:DataType>
<a:Length>15</a:Length>
<a:Precision>4</a:Precision>
</o:EntityAttribute>
<o:EntityAttribute Id="o2089">
<a:ObjectID>1B7FEEBF-264B-40EE-A199-C3866EC199C8</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Labour_Service_Cost_Amount</a:Name>
<a:Code>LABOUR_SRVC_CST_AMNT</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818155</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The planned cost in dollars for the labor and service associated with the work activity.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>N16,4</a:DataType>
<a:Length>16</a:Length>
<a:Precision>4</a:Precision>
</o:EntityAttribute>
<o:EntityAttribute Id="o2090">
<a:ObjectID>9F9D3D5E-62F6-4011-BEAB-C85CB28BC7AB</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Material_Cost_Amount</a:Name>
<a:Code>MTRL_CST_AMNT</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818155</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The planned cost in dollars for the material associated with the work activity.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>N16,4</a:DataType>
<a:Length>16</a:Length>
<a:Precision>4</a:Precision>
</o:EntityAttribute>
<o:EntityAttribute Id="o2091">
<a:ObjectID>2F7A327F-CF06-45DD-9258-E3022EFEC103</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Work_Quantity</a:Name>
<a:Code>WRK_QNTTY</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818155</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Planned Work Quantity (The number of work units estimated to complete the work.) and Actual Work Quantity (The actual amount of work done in the activity.  This is expressed in a unit of time - e.g., hours, minutes, days.)</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>N15,9</a:DataType>
<a:Length>15</a:Length>
<a:Precision>9</a:Precision>
</o:EntityAttribute>
<o:EntityAttribute Id="o2092">
<a:ObjectID>D21334AB-1319-4D96-B9EB-9284E2779AB2</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Work_Resource_ID</a:Name>
<a:Code>WRK_RSRC_ID</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818155</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A surrogate key representing a specific resource that may be used to accomplish an activity, e.g. John G. Smith, Nabors Rig #14, Bag of Cement.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>A36</a:DataType>
<a:Length>36</a:Length>
<a:LogicalAttribute.Mandatory>1</a:LogicalAttribute.Mandatory>
</o:EntityAttribute>
<o:EntityAttribute Id="o2093">
<a:ObjectID>3525C9DD-930E-4129-AE85-A171A315C60A</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Work_Order_ID</a:Name>
