<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The Feasibility Report is the proof
of &#39;do-ability&#39; of an Opportunity
(an Upstream hydrocarbon field
development, or Downstream
facility project) and marks the end
of the Assess phase of the ORP. The
Feasibility Report coincides with the
requirement to &#39;have looked wide
enough&#39; in terms of Development
Concepts and Realisations and
documents the full Opportunity solution
space considered. It further documents
concepts and/or options that have
been considered but already agreed
not to pursue further into the Select
Phase and the basis for this decision.
</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Futura Medium;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\colortbl ;\red64\green64\blue64;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.17763}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\cf1\kerning24\f0\fs16 The feasibility report documents the subsurface and surface development options and concepts being considered and the pathway to a feasible project.\par

\pard\cf0\kerning0\f1\fs20\par
}
</a:Description>
