<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Shell Digital Account is the single view of the customer from a mobile application perspective. The SDA will be the location where all of the account linkages and personal preferences will be stored as well as the users different touch points. The SDA will also include all of the users personal attributes such as First Name, Surname, etc. The SDA will also be given a unique customer reference number</a:Comment>
