<o:Entity Id="o1120">
<a:ObjectID>FD886E11-9752-413D-91C5-063BBCFE783E</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Selected Field Development Concept</a:Name>
<a:Code>SLCTD_FLD_DVLPMNT_CNCPT</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The selected surface facility and wells concept that is deemed the most competitive from a Value Cost Risk Trade off perspective, and which is robust to the range of subsurface uncertainty.

Selected Field Development Concepts can come from Field Development Scenarios.
Selected Field Development Concepts can have type 2 Capital/Operating Expenditure Estimates.
Selected Field Development Concepts can have type 2 Project Schedules.
Selected Field Development Concepts can be the basis of design for Field Development Projects.
</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Futura Medium;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
