<o:Entity Id="o1620">
<a:ObjectID>201747CD-C3E2-46A3-81B5-5865825A89DB</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Seismic Processing Project</a:Name>
<a:Code>SSMC_PRCSSNG_PRJCT</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A seismic processing project is a type of business project which manages the creation of processed seismic work products. 
A processing project may merge data from multiple field surveys, so it is not required to be equated to a single field survey.  
Original processing and re-processing activities generate separate and independent processing projects.</a:Comment>
