<a:Name>Seismic Migration Type</a:Name>
<a:Code>SSMC_MIGRATION_TYP</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Methods to rearrange seismic information elements so that reflections and diffractions are plotted at their true locations.
Class of imaging algorithm used, such as Kirchhoff, Full Wave Inversion, Reverse Time. May be qualified with domain like depth|time and prestack|poststack</a:Comment>
