<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A seismic acquisition project is a type of business project that deploys resources to the field to record seismic data.  
It may be referred to as a field survey, acquisition survey, or field program.  
It is not the same as the geometry of the deployed equipment (nav), which is a work product component</a:Comment>
