<o:Entity Id="o1271">
<a:ObjectID>D859FFD3-88D1-4431-B1F3-E4F6C354DE22</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Forecast Activity</a:Name>
<a:Code>FRCST_ACTVTY</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The action that calculates an estimate / forecast / planned number.  There are many types of forecast activities: forecast a cost, forecast a schedule, forecast a threshold, forecast volume, forecast royalty, etc.  Most of the time these forecasts are generated for a large area such as an asset (as found in business area), a field or a reservoir.  A subsequent activity then assigns the forecast cost, volume, schedule and threshold to a specific combination of case, extraction point and forecast opportunity.</a:Comment>
