<o:Entity Id="o1276">
<a:ObjectID>AFE1A2A4-6AB0-4EB8-9754-EB21095F691B</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Forecast Scenario</a:Name>
<a:Code>FRCST_SCNR</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A Forecast Scenario is a grouping of related Forecast Cases. Scenarios provide alternative views of the future. They identify some significant events, main actors and their motivations, and they convey how the world functions. Building and using scenarios can help us explore what the future might look like and the likely changes of living in it. (Shell Wiki) At Royal Dutch/Shell for example, scenario planning was viewed as changing mindsets about the exogenous part of the world, prior to formulating specific strategies.</a:Comment>
<a:ExtendedAttributesText>{C6AC31EB-C90E-4811-BE11-ED1545ECDA32},SHL_CDM_EntityPropertyExtension,1116={4E82BA4A-68B2-4115-B5EA-3B441E3475E3},MTED_EDaM_Entity_Data_Category,13=&lt;unspecified&gt;
