<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A geographical area that is publicly known or defined as having political, market or legal implications to Shell
It includes countries, country subdivisions (states, departments, provinces, etc.) cities, and areas of interest including special areas or territories (e.g., Neutral Zone), international sea or ocean areas (e.g., Gulf of Mexico, Malaysia/Thailand JDA,TA), Nature Reserves, etc.
It excludes areas defined by contractual agreement (concessions or real estate)
</a:Comment>
<a:Annotation>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Segoe UI;}}
\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs19 *** BUSINESS OWNER:\par
Operations\par
}</a:Annotation>
