<o:Entity Id="o1817">
<a:ObjectID>9616AC76-3A4A-481A-978D-88A888D1FE87</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Grid 2D</a:Name>
<a:Code>GRD_2D</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A regular 2-dimensional grid of values that represents a particular PARAMETER_TYPE (e.g. depth, thickness, temperature, Vr) over an area of the earth (or under the surface of the earth). It has a SPATIAL_LOCATION reference and an origin point (the lower left corner of the grid) that are used to place the grid spatially an area of the earth. It also contains a cell size in the X and Y directions that define the area of the grid (based on the number of cells in the X and Y directions). The Grid attribute contains the grid data as a serialized 2 dimensional array of floating point numbers.</a:Comment>
<a:ExtendedAttributesText>{77894B2F-5C8A-41A3-AAF2-C1D07AC2DAD1},BIM-core,949={53A3FEEB-9339-4A9D-9A27-884551F9DAC3},EntityCategory,11=Transaction
