<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Health Safety or Environment events that occurred since the last drilling/operation report. Captures data related to HSE events (e.g., tests, inspections, meetings, and drills), test values (e.g., pressure tested to), and/or incidents (e.g., discharges, non-compliance notices received, etc.).</a:Comment>
