<o:Entity Id="o358">
<a:ObjectID>D9CFFA4B-D090-4FAE-B5E5-E3A2CB1C84C4</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Integrated Activity Plan Rig Schedule</a:Name>
<a:Code>INTGRTD_ACTVTY_PLN_RG_SCHDL</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A Work Activity that plans the use of Rig-Work Units to carry out Well Activities such Drilling, Completing, and Restimulating.

Well Activities can be planned by Integrated Activity Plan Rig Schedules.

An Integrated Activity Plan Rig Schedule can be a kind of Work Activity as identified by its work activity nature type/grouping.

An Integrated Activity Plan Rig Schedule can plan Well Activities.

An Integrated Activity Plan Rig Schedule can utilize Rig-Work Units.

</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Futura Medium;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\colortbl ;\red64\green64\blue64;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.18362}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\cf1\kerning24\f0\fs16 A Work Activity that plans the use of Rig-Work Units to carry out Well Activities such Drilling, Completing, and Restimulating.\par
\par
Well Activities can be planned by Integrated Activity Plan Rig Schedules.\par
\par
An Integrated Activity Plan Rig Schedule can be a kind of Work Activity as identified by its work activity nature type/grouping.\par
\par
An Integrated Activity Plan Rig Schedule can plan Well Activities.\par
\par
An Integrated Activity Plan Rig Schedule can utilize Rig-Work Units.\par
\cf0\kerning0\f1\fs20\par
}
</a:Description>
