<a:Name>Play</a:Name>
<a:Code>PLY</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A named area that likely contains a combination of certain geological factors making it prospective for mineral exploration. 
It is often considered to be a set of prospects with a common set of characteristics

PLAY is defined by organizations. 
Plays fit within basins spatially, and have bounding top &amp; bottom ages defined by the basin’s stratigraphy. Individual studies break plays into play segments.</a:Comment>
