<o:Entity Id="o361">
<a:ObjectID>70238FE0-DF8F-42DD-8B56-483CFAD69083</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Pay Zone</a:Name>
<a:Code>PY_ZN</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A reservoir or portion of a reservoir that contains economically producible hydrocarbons. The term derives from the fact that it is capable of &quot;paying&quot; an income. The overall interval in which pay sections occur is the gross pay zone; the smaller portions of the gross pay zone that meet local criteria for pay (such as minimum porosity, permeability and hydrocarbon saturation) are net pay zones.

At times, the Pay Zone is also referred to as an Extraction Point. 

A Pay Zone is related to either a Reservoir or a Reservoir Segment.
</a:Comment>
<a:ExtendedAttributesText>{C6AC31EB-C90E-4811-BE11-ED1545ECDA32},SHL_CDM_EntityPropertyExtension,1113={4E82BA4A-68B2-4115-B5EA-3B441E3475E3},MTED_EDaM_Entity_Data_Category,13=&lt;unspecified&gt;
