<a:Comment>A group of persons organised for a particular purpose. Examples include: corporation, department, asset, process team, government agency, and nonprofit organisation. 

ORGANISATION is a reference provided by a data provider and represents the outside world view of organisations. The current data provider is Dun &amp; Bradstreet (D&amp;B). Shell uses this data as a reference for BUSINESS_PARTNER. </a:Comment>
