<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The Statistical Classification of Economic Activities in the European Community, commonly referred to as NACE (for the French term &quot;nomenclature statistique des activités économiques dans la Communauté européenne&quot;), is the industry standard classification system used in the European Union.

In case of multiple NACE codes for the same business partner use the primary.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>VA10</a:DataType>
<a:Length>10</a:Length>
</o:EntityAttribute>
