\pard\cf1\kerning24\f0\fs16 Case refers to an atomic entry of data. Based on the intended use of Case in Economics contexts, the logical data model portrays Cases at the lowest level, Objective, and at an alternate level, Field.\par

\pard\cf0\kerning0\f1\fs20\par
}
</a:Description>
