<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The business goal (objective) of the Reservoir.</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Futura Medium;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\colortbl ;\red89\green89\blue89;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.17763}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\cf1\kerning24\f0\fs16 The name for the uniform lowest level of production forecast data input and stored for reserves reporting. Implicitly, Objective is the lowest level for any defined reserves reporting hierarchy. The nature of each Objective is defined by the descriptive attributes recorded.\par

\pard\cf0\kerning0\f1\fs20\par
}
</a:Description>
