<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Unique Identifier for Facility
Facility ID uniquely identifies the Facility throughout it&#39;s lifecycle - The fac-id is a 32 character, hexa-decimal number that is randomly generated.  For example:  9446022-d361-446b-8db7-d3f5be834ba2</a:Comment>
