<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Represents the configuration of logging tools on a toolstring and its insertion into the wellbore. There may be more than one descent for any given trip to the wellsite, but the toolstring would be extracted from the wellbore and reconfigured before reentry.  Within a given descent, there may be multiple passes by the same logging tool configuration.</a:Comment>
