<a:Comment>License (Permit) is a formal consent granted to a Business Entity (e.g., Shell entities, non-operated ventures) by an Organisation (e.g., a regulatory agency) to perform an activity associated with a Permit Object (e.g., Facility, Equipment).

Licenses can provide regulatory approval for Field Development Opportunities.
</a:Comment>
