<o:Entity Id="o1136">
<a:ObjectID>70BB4042-D4F7-42EF-8D90-076D1DF6C23F</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Field Development Document</a:Name>
<a:Code>FLD_DVLPMNT_DCMNT</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A document that describes the field development opportunity from an integrated perspective at particular points in time throughout its ORP maturation history.

Field Development Documents can be kinds of Documents.
Field Development Documents can be integrated Feasibility Reports.
Field Development Documents can be integrated Concept Select Reports.
Field Development Documents can be integrated Project Premises Reports.
Field Development Documents can be integrated Project Execution Strategies.
Field Development Documents can be integrated Field Development Plans.
</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Futura Medium;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
