<o:Entity Id="o1121">
<a:ObjectID>47D32FF0-D7C7-4E4D-92F6-8E1F4A8B1977</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Field Development Opportunity</a:Name>
<a:Code>FLD_DVLPMNT_OPPRTNTY</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Business opportunities which require the extraction of hydrocarbons from the subsurface via wells, and that with subsequent processing enables their export and sales via long term sales agreements.  Significant risk and uncertainty is associated with Field Development Opportunities due to lack of information and data, which requires investigation, engagements, study and data acquisition through appraisal activities in order to reduce them to acceptable levels where a risk-based investment based on economic value can be made.

</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Futura Medium;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\colortbl ;\red64\green64\blue64;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.17763}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\cf1\kerning24\f0\fs16 Business opportunities which require the extraction of hydrocarbons from the subsurface via wells, and that with subsequent processing enables their export and sales via long term sales agreements.  Significant risk and uncertainty is associated with Field Development Opportunities due to lack of information and data, which requires investigation, engagements, study and data acquisition through appraisal activities in order to reduce them to acceptable levels where a risk-based investment based on economic value can be made.\par

\pard\cf0\kerning0\f1\fs20\par
}
</a:Description>
