<o:Entity Id="o1144">
<a:ObjectID>495385A4-6C1F-404F-832E-169D067156AB</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Field Development Project</a:Name>
<a:Code>FLD_DVLPMNT_PRJCT</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A Field Development Project is the selected and integrated field development scope (Surface and Wells concepts, their integrated costs and schedules, and associated production forecast(s)), supported by a Proposal to Commit to Project (PCP) following successful DG3.

Field Development Projects can have their basis of design come from Selected Field Development Concepts.
</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Futura Medium;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\colortbl ;\red64\green64\blue64;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.17763}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\cf1\kerning24\f0\fs16 A Field Development Project is the selected and integrated field development scope (Surface and Wells concepts, their integrated costs and schedules, and associated production forecast(s)), supported by a Proposal to Commit to Project (PCP) following successful DG3.\par

\pard\cf0\kerning0\f1\fs20\par
}
</a:Description>
