<o:Entity Id="o1128">
<a:ObjectID>196F2CF5-F0EA-4FDB-9B72-72D8AC9FAFB2</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Field Development Project Schedule</a:Name>
<a:Code>FLD_DVLPMNT_PRJCT_SCHDL</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The integrated timeline that describes the projects milestones, activities and deliverables, with their intended start and finish dates.  These are estimated based on resource allocation, budget, task duration and linkages of dependencies and scheduled events.

Field Development Project Schedules can be type 1 (preliminary) estimates for Field Development Scenarios.

Field Development Project Schedules can be type 2 estimates for Selected Field Development Concepts.
</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Futura Medium;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
