<o:Entity Id="o1134">
<a:ObjectID>2E7F6245-7FAF-4369-8D64-E171E26792C0</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Field Development Scenario</a:Name>
<a:Code>FLD_DVLPMNT_SCNR</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A field development scenario is the combination of a particular surface facility concept and a subsurface realization.

Field Development Scenarios can evaluate Subsurface Realisations.
Field Development Scenarios can evaluate Surface Facility Concepts.
Field Development Scenarios can have type 1 (preliminary) Capital/Operating Expenditure Estimates.
Field Development Scenarios can have type 1 (preliminary) Project Schedules.
Field Development Scenarios can become Selected Field Development Concepts.
Field Development Scenarios can result in IPSC Production Forecasts.

</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Futura Medium;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\colortbl ;\red64\green64\blue64;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.17763}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\cf1\kerning24\f0\fs16 A field development scenario is the combination of a particular surface facility concept and a subsurface realization.\par

\pard\cf0\kerning0\f1\fs20\par
}
</a:Description>
