<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Tax category identifies the type of tax used on sales or purchase. Tax categories are sales tax , purchase tax etc. 
Tax Category in Account Master Record determines whether the following applies to the G/L account:
•	Is it tax-relevant?
•	Is it a tax account?
•	Is it a tax-relevant G/L account?
</a:Comment>
