<o:Entity Id="o1635">
<a:ObjectID>4BFBC4E9-705F-4BCD-BDEE-344DFE7407FB</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Technical Service</a:Name>
<a:Code>TCHNCL_SRVC</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>An Technical Service is a set of functionality that fulfils business requirements and carries business value.  It is provided to one or more customers by an IT service provider.  It is based on the use of information technology and supports the customer&#39;s business processes. An IT service is made up from a combination of people, processes and technology, and should be defined in a service level agreement.  An IT service is the parent type of application services and  IT infrastructure services and holds the common behaviour and properties of these entities. An IT Service can consist of one or more IT services.</a:Comment>
