<o:Entity Id="o355">
<a:ObjectID>24E5B9A3-46A9-4037-8DC5-547ADD7D32CA</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Well Activity Measurement</a:Name>
<a:Code>WLL_ACTVTY_MSRMNT</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A metric that is captured during the execution of a Well Activity.  Many KPIs include multiple Well Activity Measurements in their calculation.

Work Objects can have action taken against them by Work Activities.

A Work Object can be a Work Object Equipment or Work Object Facility.</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Futura Medium;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\colortbl ;\red64\green64\blue64;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.18362}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\cf1\kerning24\f0\fs16 A metric that is captured during the execution of a Well Activity.  Many KPIs include multiple Well Activity Measurements in their calculation.\par
\par
Work Objects can have action taken against them by Work Activities.\par
\par
A Work Object can be a Work Object Equipment or Work Object Facility.\cf0\kerning0\f1\fs20\par
}
</a:Description>
