<o:Entity Id="o547">
<a:ObjectID>1632289D-A162-418B-BE94-4D32A829F586</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Well Status</a:Name>
<a:Code>WLL_STTS</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>An important time bound condition of a Well.

Well Statuses can be achieved over time by Wells.

A Well Status can be Drilling Completion Status, Well Integrity Status, or Production Well Status.</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Futura Medium;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\colortbl ;\red64\green64\blue64;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.18362}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\cf1\kerning24\f0\fs16 An important time bound condition of a Well.\par
\par
Well Statuses can be achieved over time by Wells.\par
\par
A Well Status can be Drilling Completion Status, Well Integrity Status, or Production Well Status.\cf0\kerning0\f1\fs20\par
}
</a:Description>
