<o:Entity Id="o152">
<a:ObjectID>F17B39B4-F637-45D4-972F-8BB67174E2A2</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Wellbore</a:Name>
<a:Code>WLLBR</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A unique path from a well surface point or the highest point of interest above the surface of the well, to a bottom hole point. If more than one path exists from a wellbore surface point to a bottom point, then more than one wellbore exists.</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.18362}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20 A unique path from a well surface point or the highest point of interest above the surface of the well, to a bottom hole point. If more than one path exists from a wellbore surface point to a bottom point, then more than one wellbore exists.\par
}
</a:Description>
