<o:Entity Id="o213">
<a:ObjectID>11697AF7-C26A-4FE9-AD64-11C41E30F9B6</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Wellbore Assembly</a:Name>
<a:Code>WLLBR_ASSMBLY</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Materials and equipment assembled in a linear, ordered fashion and placed as a unit in a WELLBORE.
WELL ASSEMBLIES do not exist outside their installation in a WELLBORE.
When a WELL ASSEMBLY exists in one or more WELLBORES, it is assigned to the lowest numbered WELLBORE in which the WELL ASSEMBLY has its maximum depth.  A WELL ASSEMBLY is assigned to only one WELLBORE.
</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.18362}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20 Materials and equipment assembled in a linear, ordered fashion and placed as a unit in a WELLBORE.\par
WELL ASSEMBLIES do not exist outside their installation in a WELLBORE.\par
When a WELL ASSEMBLY exists in one or more WELLBORES, it is assigned to the lowest numbered WELLBORE in which the WELL ASSEMBLY has its maximum depth.  A WELL ASSEMBLY is assigned to only one WELLBORE.\par
}
</a:Description>
