<o:Entity Id="o153">
<a:ObjectID>ECA3BC20-657B-42C5-ABD7-5415D0206A06</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Wellbore Path</a:Name>
<a:Code>WLLBR_PTH</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The collection of Wellbore Path Points for a Wellbore, each of which is a consistent interval from its adjacent point(s).

Wellbore Paths can have each foot indicated by Wellbore Path Points.

Wellbore Paths can show the consistent interval progression of drilled Wellbores.

Wellbore Paths can be geographically pinpointed at Spatial </a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Futura Medium;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\colortbl ;\red64\green64\blue64;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.18362}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\cf1\kerning24\f0\fs16\lang2057 The collection of Wellbore Path Points for a Wellbore, each of which is a consistent interval from its adjacent point(s).\par
\par
Wellbore Paths can have each foot indicated by Wellbore Path Points.\par
\par
Wellbore Paths can show the consistent interval progression of drilled Wellbores.\par
\par
Wellbore Paths can be geographically pinpointed at Spatial Locations.\cf0\kerning0\f1\fs20\lang1033\par
}
</a:Description>
