<o:Entity Id="o154">
<a:ObjectID>FD261710-DFDE-4A6E-832B-A5910BF91D79</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Wellbore Path Point</a:Name>
<a:Code>WLLBR_PTH_PNT</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A point on a Wellbore that is one foot apart from its adjacent points on the same Wellbore.

The Wellbore Path Point’s specific location is determined by interpolating between two measured Directional Survey Points (even though for a Composite Directional Survey the measurements may not have been taken on the same Measured Directional Survey).

Wellbore Path Points can be algorithmically derived from Directional Survey Points.

Wellbore Path Points can indicate consistent intervals of Wellbore Paths.

Wellbore Path Points can be geographically pinpointed at Spatial Locations.</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Futura Medium;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\colortbl ;\red64\green64\blue64;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.18362}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\cf1\kerning24\f0\fs16 A point on a Wellbore that is one foot apart from its adjacent points on the same Wellbore.\par
\par
The Wellbore Path Point\rquote s specific location is determined by interpolating between two measured Directional Survey Points (even though for a Composite Directional Survey the measurements may not have been taken on the same Measured Directional Survey).\par
\par
Wellbore Path Points can be algorithmically derived from Directional Survey Points.\par
\par
Wellbore Path Points can indicate consistent intervals of Wellbore Paths.\par
\par
Wellbore Path Points can be geographically pinpointed at Spatial Locations.\cf0\kerning0\f1\fs20\par
}
</a:Description>
