<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Also called a deviation survey, wellbore trajectory is data that is used to calculate the position and spatial uncertainty of a planned or actual wellbore in 2-dimensional and 3-dimensional space.</a:Comment>
<a:ExtendedAttributesText>{77894B2F-5C8A-41A3-AAF2-C1D07AC2DAD1},BIM-core,936={257C2933-14F9-47BB-939B-506E3F475E84},DesignStatus,8=Approved
