<o:Entity Id="o149">
<a:ObjectID>E773DD15-6B54-4D7E-84BD-13348FDF0B6D</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Directional Survey</a:Name>
<a:Code>DRCTNL_SRVY</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A survey taken while drilling using continuous measuring technology or a survey made through drill tools at such intervals to accurately determine the location of the deviated well bore.
A Directional Survey is also known as a Deviation Survey.</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.18362}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20 A survey taken while drilling using continuous measuring technology or a survey made through drill tools at such intervals to accurately determine the location of the deviated well bore.\par
A Directional Survey is also known as a Deviation Survey.\par
}
</a:Description>
