<a:ModificationDate>1775818155</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Indicates that the Type is Inactive and may not be used. Prior useages when the type was Active are still valid. If the Type is to no longer to be used, then it will be set to Inactive. At a later time, the indicator can be set back to Active if it can begin to be used again. No requirement exists to record the date effectivity of the inactive state of the type over time.</a:Comment>
