<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Any logical item of data used in subsurface modelling e.g. Petrel Projects, Eclipse, Rescue-B, seismic data in various formats, Excel workbooks. It is either a communication between 2 adjacent steps in a workflow in an agreed format or the working representation used at one point in the workflow which transforms an incoming Work Product into an outgoing one.</a:Comment>
