<o:Entity Id="o346">
<a:ObjectID>129F8FA6-9163-4A01-860C-04197C271192</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Well Activity</a:Name>
<a:Code>WLL_ACTVTY</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A Work Activity that takes action against a Well or a part of a Well.

Well Activities can be planned by Integrated Activity Plan Rig Schedules.

Well Activities can take action against Wells.

Well Activities can take action against Wellbores.

Well Activities can result in Well Activity Measurements.

A Well Activity can be Well Planning/Designing, Drilling, Completing, Assuring Operational Readiness, Operating/Producing, Maintaining, Restimulating, or Decommissioning/Abandoning.

A Well Activity can be a kind of Work Activity as identified by its work activity nature type/grouping.
</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Futura Medium;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\colortbl ;\red64\green64\blue64;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.18362}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\cf1\kerning24\f0\fs16 A Work Activity that takes action against a Well or a part of a Well.\par
\par
Well Activities can be planned by Integrated Activity Plan Rig Schedules.\par
\par
Well Activities can take action against Wells.\par
\par
Well Activities can take action against Wellbores.\par
\par
Well Activities can result in Well Activity Measurements.\par
\par
A Well Activity can be Well Planning/Designing, Drilling, Completing, Assuring Operational Readiness, Operating/Producing, Maintaining, Restimulating, or Decommissioning/Abandoning.\par
\par
A Well Activity can be a kind of Work Activity as identified by its work activity nature type/grouping.\cf0\kerning0\f1\fs20\par
}
</a:Description>
