<a:Comment>As Geopolitical: Any geographically bounded area of legal or regulatory relevance. This could be but is not limited to a country or subdivision thereof, tax region, grouping of countries such as the European Union, disputed areas, but also environmental areas such as natural parks. As Country: An area of land or territory of a nation or state.
