<o:Entity Id="o172">
<a:ObjectID>EFF24D21-09EF-42DE-9F55-9804924D92A5</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Coring</a:Name>
<a:Code>CRNG</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The activity of acquiring a core from within a wellbore. The two predominant types are by drilling, or by sidewall. In drilling a cylindrical sample of rock is collected using a core bit in conjunction with a core barrel and core catcher. Sidewall cores are taken from the side of the borehole, usually by a wireline tool. Sidewall cores may be taken using percussion or mechanical drilling.</a:Comment>
<a:ExtendedAttributesText>{77894B2F-5C8A-41A3-AAF2-C1D07AC2DAD1},BIM-core,936={257C2933-14F9-47BB-939B-506E3F475E84},DesignStatus,8=Approved
