<o:Entity Id="o1119">
<a:ObjectID>9049D0EB-3908-4E54-9279-F0179D42B84C</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Surface Facility Concept</a:Name>
<a:Code>SRFC_FCLTY_CNCPT</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A Surface Facilities Concept defines a set of the surface facilities that satisfies the subsurface and wells requirements, treats and delivers the well fluid to an agreed end point and quality.

Surface Facility Concepts can satisfy Field Development Opportunities above the surface.

Surface Facility Concepts can be evaluated in Field Development Scenarios.

Surface Facility Concepts can call for (Proposed) Surface Facilities.

</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Futura Medium;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\colortbl ;\red64\green64\blue64;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.17763}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\cf1\kerning24\f0\fs16\lang2057 A Surface Facilities Concept defines a set of the surface facilities that satisfies the subsurface and wells requirements, treats and delivers the well fluid to an agreed end point and quality.\par

\pard\cf0\kerning0\f1\fs20\lang1033\par
}
</a:Description>
