<o:Entity Id="o1122">
<a:ObjectID>C7C41ADB-5191-4FB8-97D5-DF6B085133E6</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Surface Facility</a:Name>
<a:Code>SRFC_FCLTY</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A surface facility treats and delivers well fluids to a desired end point with an agreed quality. It satisfies the subsurface requirements in terms fluid injection and or disposal. It satisfies the Wells requirements in terms of artificial lift if needed.

(Proposed) Surface Facilities can be called for by Surface Facility Concepts.

(Proposed) Surface Facilities can have their design constrained by Surface Facility Key Parameters.

Surface Facilities can be kinds of Facilities.
</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Futura Medium;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\colortbl ;\red64\green64\blue64;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.17763}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\cf1\kerning24\f0\fs16 A surface facility treats and delivers well fluids to a desired end point with an agreed quality. It satisfies the subsurface requirements in terms fluid injection and or disposal. It satisfies the Wells requirements in terms of artificial lift if needed.\par

\pard\cf0\kerning0\f1\fs20\par
}
</a:Description>
