<o:Entity Id="o1132">
<a:ObjectID>97324BDC-F47C-430E-B8EE-652120B0868A</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Capital Operating Expenditure Estimate</a:Name>
<a:Code>CPTL_OPRTNG_EXPNDTR_ESTMT</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The Capital Expenditure Estimate defines the money required to design, procure and drill/construct/install the Wells and the Surface Facilities, as described in the Estimate and Schedule Basis Report. The Operating Expenditure defines the money required to Operate the Wells and Surface facilities.

Capital/Operating Expenditure Estimates can be type 1 (preliminary) estimates for Field Development Scenarios.

Capital/Operating Expenditure Estimates can be type 2 estimates for Selected Field Development Concepts.

</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Futura Medium;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\colortbl ;\red64\green64\blue64;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.17763}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\cf1\kerning24\f0\fs16 The integrated timeline that describes the projects milestones, activities and deliverables, with their intended start and finish dates.  These are estimated based on resource allocation, budget, task duration and linkages of dependencies and scheduled events.\par

\pard\cf0\kerning0\f1\fs20\par
}
</a:Description>
