<o:Entity Id="o536">
<a:ObjectID>220945FB-A755-4414-8BCB-E545CF52AD08</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Completion Primary Fluid</a:Name>
<a:Code>CMPLTN_PRMRY_FLD</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1775817984</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The fact that a particular fluid (oil, gas etc.) is the primary product of a COMPLETION.
The product does not change just because the COMPLETION is used intermittently to produce or inject another product.  That is, a business may periodically inject steam into an oil producer, but this does not change the product from oil to steam.</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.18362}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20 The fact that a particular fluid (oil, gas etc.) is the primary product of a COMPLETION.\par
The product does not change just because the COMPLETION is used intermittently to produce or inject another product.  That is, a business may periodically inject steam into an oil producer, but this does not change the product from oil to steam.\par
}
</a:Description>
<a:ExtendedAttributesText>{C6AC31EB-C90E-4811-BE11-ED1545ECDA32},SHL_CDM_EntityPropertyExtension,783={4E82BA4A-68B2-4115-B5EA-3B441E3475E3},MTED_EDaM_Entity_Data_Category,13=&lt;unspecified&gt;
