<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1775818154</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The major reason a COMPLETION exists.
The purpose does not change just because the COMPLETION is used intermittently for another purpose.  (A business may periodically inject steam or diluent into a producer, but this does not change the purpose of the COMPLETION from producer to injector.)</a:Comment>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.18362}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20 The major reason a COMPLETION exists.\par
The purpose does not change just because the COMPLETION is used intermittently for another purpose.  (A business may periodically inject steam or diluent into a producer, but this does not change the purpose of the COMPLETION from producer to injector.)\par
}
</a:Description>
<a:Annotation>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Segoe UI;}}
\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs19 *** PURPOSE:\par
Injector\par
Observer\par
Producer\par
Disposer\par
}</a:Annotation>
